      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-a-scheduler-tick-handles-47": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-a-scheduler-tick-handles-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A scheduler tick handles one wake event by refreshing deterministic epoch state,\nrecording the result, and marking the event handled. If no schedulable board\nwork exists, the scheduler records claim pressure and backs off according to\npolicy rather than spinning or falling back to a model-driven replan."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-worker-delegation-48": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-worker-delegation-48",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Worker Delegation"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-an-epoch-target-plus-tar-49": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-an-epoch-target-plus-tar-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An epoch target plus target claim is the bounded delegation contract. It names\nthe unit, symbol, source path, current score evidence, priority, reason, and\nexplicit write set. The worker receives target-local context and validation\nexpectations, but it does not receive board-level authority."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-the-scheduler-can-admit-50": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-the-scheduler-can-admit-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The scheduler can admit a previously attempted target into a later epoch only\nwhen deterministic routing has authority to do so, such as regression repair,\naccepted new facts, or explicit operator policy. Normal admission stays biased\ntoward fresh, graph-ranked work."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-worker-checkpoint-contra-51": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-worker-checkpoint-contra-51",
      "type": "heading",
