          "insert": "Facts, blockers, and negative evidence preserved in the worker-state summary."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-run-director-loop-only-hard-gate-passing-i-57": {
      "id": "b-10-run-director-loop-only-hard-gate-passing-i-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Only hard-gate-passing improvements are selectable for tentative integration.\nExact checkpoints win over non-exact checkpoints, then highest score wins, then\nearliest validation time. Only confirmed integrations are eligible for PR\npreparation. Future scheduling consumes durable worker states and checkpoint\nevidence, not hidden conversation state."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    }
